        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalEulerAnglesHint.y
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5424471940125407098, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalEulerAnglesHint.z
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[0]
      value: '<align=center><b>Quantum Fringe Patterns With and Without Waves</b><br></align><br>
        <b></b>In this world, wave simulations are placed alongside quantum scattering
        simulations to demonstrate how research by Carolyne Van Vliet and William
        Duane enables replication of the single- and double-slit experiments without
        interference. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[1]
      value: "<align=center><b>\u6CE2\u306E\u6709\u7121\u306B\u3088\u308B\u91CF\u5B50\u5E72\u6E09\u7E1E</b><br></align><br>
        <b></b>\u3053\u3053\u3067\u306F\u3001\u6CE2\u306E\u30B7\u30DF\u30E5\u30EC\u30FC\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3068\u91CF\u5B50\u6563\u4E71\u30B7\u30DF\u30E5\u30EC\u30FC\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u4E26\u3079\u3066\u5C55\u793A\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308C\u306B\u3088\u308A\u3001\u30AD\u30E3\u30ED\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u30FB\u30F4\u30A1\u30F3\u30FB\u30D5\u30EA\u30FC\u30C8\u3068\u30A6\u30A3\u30EA\u30A2\u30E0\u30FB\u30C7\u30E5\u30A2\u30F3\u306E\u7814\u7A76\u304C\u3044\u304B\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u5E72\u6E09\u3092\u4F34\u308F\u305A\u306B\u5358\u30B9\u30EA\u30C3\u30C8\u304A\u3088\u3073\u4E8C\u91CD\u30B9\u30EA\u30C3\u30C8\u5B9F\u9A13\u3092\u518D\u73FE\u53EF\u80FD\u306B\u3059\u308B\u304B\u3092\u793A\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[2]
      value: "<size=110%><align=center><b>\u6709\u6CE2\u548C\u7121\u6CE2\u7684\u91CF\u5B50\u4E7E\u6D89\u689D\u7D0B\u5716\u6848</b><br></align><br>
        <b></b>\u5728\u9019\u500B\u4E16\u754C\u88E1\uFF0C\u6CE2\u52D5\u6A21\u64EC\u8207\u91CF\u5B50\u6563\u5C04\u6A21\u64EC\u4E26\u5217\u5C55\u793A\uFF0C\u4EE5\u8B49\u660E
        Carolyne Van Vliet \u548C William Duane \u7684\u7814\u7A76\u5982\u4F55\u80FD\u5920\u5728\u4E0D\u767C\u751F\u5E72\u6D89\u7684\u60C5\u6CC1\u4E0B\u8907\u88FD\u55AE\u7E2B\u548C\u96D9\u7E2B\u5BE6\u9A57\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[3]
      value: "<size=110%><align=center><b>\u6709\u6CE2\u4E0E\u65E0\u6CE2\u6761\u4EF6\u4E0B\u7684\u91CF\u5B50\u5E72\u6D89\u6761\u7EB9</b><br></align><br>
        \u5728\u6B64\u5C55\u793A\u4E2D\uFF0C\u6CE2\u6A21\u62DF\u4E0E\u91CF\u5B50\u6563\u5C04\u6A21\u62DF\u5E76\u5217\u5448\u73B0\uFF0C\u65E8\u5728\u6F14\u793A
        Carolyne Van Vliet \u548C William Duane \u7684\u7814\u7A76\u5982\u4F55\u5B9E\u73B0\u65E0\u9700\u5E72\u6D89\u5373\u53EF\u590D\u73B0\u5355\u7F1D\u53CA\u53CC\u7F1D\u5B9E\u9A8C\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[4]
      value: "<size=110%><align=center><b>\uD30C\uB3D9\uC774 \uC788\uB294 \uACBD\uC6B0\uC640
        \uC5C6\uB294 \uACBD\uC6B0\uC758 \uC591\uC790 \uAC04\uC12D\uBB34\uB2AC</b><br></align><br>
        \uC774 \uC804\uC2DC\uC5D0\uC11C\uB294 \uCE90\uB864\uB77C\uC778 \uBC18 \uBE14\uB9AC\uD2B8(Carolyne
        Van Vliet)\uC640 \uC70C\uB9AC\uC5C4 \uB4C0\uC548(William Duane)\uC758 \uC5F0\uAD6C\uB97C
        \uD1B5\uD574 \uAC04\uC12D \uD604\uC0C1 \uC5C6\uC774\uB3C4 \uB2E8\uC77C \uBC0F
        \uC774\uC911 \uC2AC\uB9BF \uC2E4\uD5D8\uC744 \uC7AC\uD604\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC74C\uC744
        \uBCF4\uC5EC\uC8FC\uAE30 \uC704\uD574, \uD30C\uB3D9 \uC2DC\uBBAC\uB808\uC774\uC158\uACFC
        \uC591\uC790 \uC0B0\uB780 \uC2DC\uBBAC\uB808\uC774\uC158\uC744 \uB098\uB780\uD788
        \uBC30\uCE58\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[5]
      value: "<align=center><b>Padr\xF5es de Franjas Qu\xE2nticas com e sem Ondas</b><br></align><br>
        <b></b>Neste mundo, simula\xE7\xF5es de ondas s\xE3o apresentadas lado a
        lado com simula\xE7\xF5es de espalhamento qu\xE2ntico para demonstrar como
        as pesquisas de Carolyne Van Vliet e William Duane possibilitam a reprodu\xE7\xE3o
        dos experimentos de fenda simples e dupla sem interfer\xEAncia."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[6]
      value: "<align=center><b>Figures de franges quantiques avec et sans ondes</b><br></align><br>
        Dans ce contexte, des simulations ondulatoires sont pr\xE9sent\xE9es aux
        c\xF4t\xE9s de simulations de diffusion quantique pour d\xE9montrer comment
        les travaux de Carolyne Van Vliet et de William Duane permettent de reproduire
        les exp\xE9riences \xE0 une et deux fentes sans interf\xE9rence."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: serializationData.Prefab
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6313274347133426041, guid: c328e3cd83fb5284a92c73432116a752,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: serializationData.SerializedFormat
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
